# GitHub CODEOWNERS
# This file specifies automatic code review requirements
# for different parts of the repository.
#
# Syntax: <path> <@owner1> <@owner2>
# When paths match, owners are automatically requested for PR review.
#
# Configuration: Settings → Code review limits → Show code owners
#
# References:
# - https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
# - CODEOWNERS must be in root, .github/, or docs/ directory

# ============================================
# Default - All files in repo
# ============================================
* @guste  # Primary maintainer


# ============================================
# Infrastructure & Terraform
# ============================================
/terraform/                          @guste @platform-team
/terraform/environments/prod/        @guste @devops-leads  # Prod requires extra scrutiny
/terraform/modules/rds/              @guste @database-team
/terraform/modules/security_groups/  @guste @security-team
/terraform/modules/kms/              @guste @security-team
/terraform/modules/cloudtrail/       @guste @security-team
/terraform/backends/                 @guste @devops-leads


# ============================================
# CI/CD & GitHub Actions
